<h3>2026-10-30 — Chat invoice supplier question now lists the choices</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> When Chat-with-AI asks which supplier fits, the reply now names each candidate and the chat draws a button per supplier.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The server already had the list, but the widget only printed “Several Shanta suppliers could fit. Which one?” with no names.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Model/AI2/InvoiceCreate.pm</code>, <code>root/static/js/ai-chat/feature-invoice.js</code>, <code>local-chat.js</code>, <code>ai2editor/chat.js</code>, <code>js_load.tt</code>, <code>ai/widget.tt</code></p>
